From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 09:33:07 -0647
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: google,zumapro: Add the HSI0 USI3 clocks

Signed-off-by: W4HO <87742609+W4HO-ham@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml      | 4 ++--
 include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h                   | 5 +++++
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml
index f71b12f3e..fa9d61110 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/clock/google,zumapro-clock.yaml
@@ -17,8 +17,8 @@ description: |
   CMU_MISC supplies the firmware-owned watchdog bus clock paths.
   CMU_PERIC0 supplies its GPIO bank and USI2-USI6 (the cameras' and the
   battery's I2C buses), the USIs from CMU_TOP's optional PERIC0 IP clock.
-  CMU_HSI0 supplies the USB, eUSB2 PHY and touchscreen USI2 clocks; its
-  ALT and TCXO inputs are board-level fixed clocks.
+  CMU_HSI0 supplies the USB, eUSB2 PHY, touchscreen USI2 and GNSS SPI USI3
+  clocks; its ALT and TCXO inputs are board-level fixed clocks.
   CMU_G3D supplies the GPU's core, coregroup and stacks clocks from its two
   PLLs and CMU_TOP's G3D NoC, global and switch clocks.
   CMU_HSI1 supplies the HSI1 GPIO bank's clock; its ALT input is a
diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
index 972d9c9f5..2560150f8 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/google,zumapro.h
@@ -98,6 +98,11 @@
 #define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USB_SUBCTL	20
 #define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USB_LINK		21
 #define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USB_SUSPEND	22
+#define CLK_MOUT_HSI0_USI3_LOCAL	23
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI3_SOURCE	24
+#define CLK_DOUT_HSI0_USI3		25
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI3_IP		26
+#define CLK_GOUT_HSI0_USI3_PCLK		27
 
 /* CMU_G3D. */
 #define CLK_FOUT_G3D			1
